- `/icon.svg`: own folded-sheet icon.
- `/opengraph-image.png` and `/twitter-image.png`: own 1200×630 cards and alt text, generated by workspace scripts/draw-share.py using installed DejaVu system fonts and original geometry. Cards foreground the user's named working documents, no unscoped programme metrics.
