Setup verified: Node v24.14.0 with native TypeScript actually executed, npm 11.9.0, git 2.53.0. Neutral browser page captured/inspected. Empty read-only .git means workspace is not a git repository; no commits possible/claimed. Only storyfolio advertised/enabled; installed local skill read, no skill additions.

